caption: Numerical Mastery

Wuxia — Tier 2: 100 character points invested in qualifying Tradition or Style purchases; complete all five Duan Wei. A skill or ordinary technique is mastered at effective 16; a technique based on an active defense is mastered at effective 10. Preserve every Duan Wei critical-success and family requirement.
